review:
I've played other popular card games, but Faeria is the one [b]I always come back[/b] to. It is that fun!

[b]Pros:[/b][list]
[*]Beautiful [b]soundtrack[/b], sound effects and art;
[*]Fun cards with many different [b]powers[/b];
[*]Amazing [b]atmosphere[/b];
[*][b]Challenging[/b] puzzles;
[*]PvP;
[*]Super [b]fun![/b][/list]

[b]Cons:[/b][list]
[*]Game progress doesn't sync across platforms and consoles;
[*]You cannot change your [b]gamer name[/b], when you launch Faeria the game grabs your current Steam name and it'll be the one you'll use to play online.[/list]

Give this game a chance, there's a 99% change that you'll [b]love it.[/b] I did!
